      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'It has been split up into 4 seperate parts and strewn throughout the
        Groningen University Museum.


        Explore the museum, beat the 4 mini
        games and rebuild your brain!


        Keybindings:


        Movement:
        WASD

        Interact: E

        Look around with the mouse. '
